        "original_id": "1ac8a2cb-1ce6-5cd6-9e44-e735920a3219",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rose Byrne, Ben Lee, Nicholas Stoller, Jonah Hill, Russell Brand, Judd Apatow\n- Films: The Rage in Placid Lake, Troy, 28 Weeks Later, Knowing, Insidious, Get Him to the Greek, Bridesmaids, Neighbors, Spy, Forgetting Sarah Marshall\n- Places: Australia\n- Roles: actress, director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Rose Byrne was born on 24 July 1979 and is an Australian actress.\n- The Rage in Placid Lake is a 2003 Australian film starring Ben Lee and Rose Byrne.\n- Get Him to the Greek was released on June 4, 2010.\n- Get Him to the Greek is a spin-off sequel to Nicholas Stoller’s 2008 film Forgetting Sarah Marshall.\n- Get Him to the Greek reunited director Nicholas Stoller with stars Jonah Hill and Russell Brand and producer Judd Apatow.\n- Rose Byrne starred in the films Troy, 28 Weeks Later, Knowing, Insidious, Get Him to the Greek, Bridesmaids, Neighbors, and Spy.",
